---
description: Browser conventions for Phaser games
globs: games/**/src/client/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Keep Phaser as the game engine. Use same-origin fetches to `/api/` and `@devvit/web/client` for Reddit UI effects and Realtime subscriptions. Do not import server modules or make external network requests from the webview.

Keep the HTML splash lightweight, request expanded mode from a user gesture, handle missing `context.userId`, and resynchronize multiplayer state on reconnect. localStorage is version-specific and is not durable across app updates.
